    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\n19 Mountain View Drive is a well-presented three-bedroom mid-terrace family home ideally positioned along this mature and highly regarded residential road in the heart of Churchtown. Benefiting from a bright and spacious interior, off-street parking to the front and a private rear garden with side access, this attractive home is sure to appeal to first-time buyers, growing families and those seeking a home in one of South Dublin's most established residential locations.\n\nThe accommodation briefly comprises a bright entrance porch leading to a welcoming entrance hallway with understairs storage. To the front, there is a spacious living room featuring a fireplace and overlooking the front garden. To the rear lies a generous open-plan kitchen/dining room fitted with a range of floor and wall-mounted units together with direct access to the rear garden through sliding patio doors. Upstairs, there are three well-proportioned bedrooms, a family bathroom and a landing area incorporating a hot press.\n\nThe rear garden benefits from a block-built shed together with side access, providing excellent additional storage and practicality for everyday family living.\n\nThe location is second to none, with every conceivable amenity within easy reach including Nutgrove Shopping Centre, Dundrum Town Centre, local shops, parks and an excellent selection of well-established primary and secondary schools. The area is also exceptionally well serviced by public transport, including numerous Dublin Bus routes and the Luas at Dundrum, while the nearby M50 provides excellent access to the city centre and surrounding areas.\n\nThis is an excellent opportunity to acquire a well-maintained family home in a highly convenient and sought-after residential location."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nPorch - 0.85m x 1.85m\nBright entrance porch with tiled flooring and double-glazed windows.\n\nEntrance Hallway - 3.68mm x 1.85m\nLaminate flooring, radiator, light fixture and under-stairs storage.\n\nLiving Room - 3.77m x 3.79m\nBright and spacious reception room with laminate flooring, feature fireplace, radiator and light fixture.\n\nKitchen/Dining Room - 2.44m x 5.74m\nOpen-plan kitchen/dining area with laminate flooring in the dining area and tiled flooring in the kitchen, tiled splashback and tiled wall finish. Fitted with a Samsung fridge freezer, Beko gas hob and oven, Candy extractor hood, Whirlpool washing machine and sink. Sliding doors provide direct access to the rear garden.\n\nLanding - 2.13m x 3.84m\nCarpet flooring, light fixture and hot press.\n\nBedroom 1 - 3.29m x 4.21m\nDouble bedroom with carpet flooring, fitted slide robes and light fixture.\n\nBedroom 2 - 3.51m x 3.16m\nLaminate flooring, radiator and light fixture.\n\nBedroom 3 - 2.69m x 2.78m\nLaminate flooring, radiator, light fixture and storage cupboard.\n\nBathroom - 2.45m x 2.44m\nFully tiled bathroom comprising bath, w.c., wash hand basin, mirrored vanity unit, radiator and storage cupboard.\n\nRear Garden - \nPrivate rear garden with block-built shed and side access passage.\n\n"
      },
